"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Name of Hope","synopsis":"The Fafners are deployed to save a Human Army transport craft from a Festum. It's the first battle in two years, but Hiroto, Rina, Akira, Sui, and Maya are all smiles as they calmly board the Fafners. They dominate the battle until the experienced Festum unleashes an attack style they've never seen before, leaving the five pilots at a loss. Then unexpected reinforcements arrive...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The Fafners are deployed to save a Human Army transport craft from a Festum. It's the first battle in two years, but Hiroto, Rina, Akira, Sui, and Maya are all smiles as they calmly board the Fafners. They dominate the battle until the experienced Festum unleashes an attack style they've never seen before, leaving the five pilots at a loss. Then unexpected reinforcements arrive...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5099064.jpg"},{"title":"The Price of a Conversation","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9639","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17080","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17080","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"89344","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Price of a Conversation","synopsis":"Mitsuhiro and the other Human Army pilots visit the café Rakuen on Tatsumiyajima. Billy excitedly devours his curry and Ai takes notice of Kazuki, while Mitsuhiro keeps a close eye on the scene and Maya watches them all with a thoughtful expression. Miwa has met Emery and the two happily converse in some special way that only they understand, while Miwa's mother, Yumiko, watches with concern. Meanwhile, Fumihiko is shocked by the information offered by General Narain. A frightening situation that could change the world's balance of power is pressing closer.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Mitsuhiro and the other Human Army pilots visit the café Rakuen on Tatsumiyajima. Billy excitedly devours his curry and Ai takes notice of Kazuki, while Mitsuhiro keeps a close eye on the scene and Maya watches them all with a thoughtful expression. Miwa has met Emery and the two happily converse in some special way that only they understand, while Miwa's mother, Yumiko, watches with concern. Meanwhile, Fumihiko is shocked by the information offered by General Narain. A frightening situation that could change the world's balance of power is pressing closer.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5099065.jpg"},{"title":"The Successors","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9639","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"17080","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"17080","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"89343","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Successors","synopsis":"Three new pilots have been chosen: Mikado Reo, Kaburagi Sui, and Mikagami Mimika, third-year students at Tatsumiyajima Middle School and juniors to Kazuki and the other pilots. They have received more advanced genetic manipulation than the previous pilots, and each has unique strengths. Hazama Yuuko and Canon prepare their mechs, but the new pilots are dissatisfied with their colors and names... Meanwhile, Fumihiko and Chizuru have the difficult job of notifying the new pilots' families of their children's new placement.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Three new pilots have been chos